{"id":"pemrograman/css/bootstrap/06.-formulir-dan-validasi","title":"06. Formulir dan Validasi","slug":"06. formulir dan validasi","relativePath":"Pemrograman/CSS/Bootstrap/06. Formulir dan Validasi.md","folder":"Pemrograman/CSS/Bootstrap","frontmatter":{"tags":[],"aliases":[]},"tags":["programming"],"aliases":[],"headings":[{"depth":2,"text":"1. Elemen Input Standar (*Form Controls*)","id":"1-elemen-input-standar-form-controls"},{"depth":2,"text":"2. Label Melayang Modern (*Floating Labels*)","id":"2-label-melayang-modern-floating-labels"},{"depth":2,"text":"3. Gabungan Input dan Ikon (*Input Groups*)","id":"3-gabungan-input-dan-ikon-input-groups"},{"depth":2,"text":"4. Kotak Centang, Radio, dan Saklar (*Switches*)","id":"4-kotak-centang-radio-dan-saklar-switches"},{"depth":2,"text":"5. Validasi Formulir Interaktif","id":"5-validasi-formulir-interaktif"}],"content":"#programming \n\nBootstrap 5 menyediakan sistem penataan formulir yang bersih, mudah diakses melalui keyboard, dan mendukung validasi visual yang responsif.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Elemen Input Standar (*Form Controls*)\n\nGunakan class `.form-control` pada tag `<input>` atau `<textarea>` agar input memiliki padding proporsional, border lembut, dan fokus ring berwarna biru:\n\n```html\n<div class=\"mb-3\">\n  <label for=\"inputEmail\" class=\"form-label fw-semibold small\">Alamat Email</label>\n  <input type=\"email\" class=\"form-control rounded-3\" id=\"inputEmail\" placeholder=\"nama@domain.com\">\n  <div class=\"form-text text-secondary\">Kami tidak akan membagikan email Anda kepada pihak ketiga.</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n---\n\n## 2. Label Melayang Modern (*Floating Labels*)\n\nBootstrap 5 memperkenalkan fitur *Floating Labels* tanpa membutuhkan pustaka luar. Cukup bungkus input dan label di dalam container ber-class `.form-floating`:\n\n```html\n<div class=\"form-floating mb-3\">\n  <!-- Wajib sertakan atribut placeholder meskipun kosong -->\n  <input type=\"email\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"floatingEmail\" placeholder=\"nama@domain.com\">\n  <label for=\"floatingEmail\">Ketikkan Alamat Email</label>\n</div>\n```\nSaat input dalam keadaan kosong, teks label berada di tengah. Begitu pengguna mengklik atau mengetik teks, label otomatis melayang naik ke atas dengan ukuran huruf lebih kecil.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Gabungan Input dan Ikon (*Input Groups*)\n\nGunakan `.input-group` untuk menempelkan teks simbol mata uang, ikon, atau tombol langsung di samping kotak input:\n\n```html\n<!-- Input dengan Awalan Simbol Mata Uang -->\n<div class=\"input-group mb-3\">\n  <span class=\"input-group-text bg-light text-secondary\">Rp</span>\n  <input type=\"number\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"100000\">\n  <span class=\"input-group-text bg-light text-secondary\">,00</span>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Input Pencarian Lengkap dengan Tombol Aksi -->\n<div class=\"input-group\">\n  <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"Cari artikel...\">\n  <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" type=\"button\">Cari</button>\n</div>\n```\n\n---\n\n## 4. Kotak Centang, Radio, dan Saklar (*Switches*)\n\nGunakan `.form-check` untuk menjaga agar teks label sejajar sempurna dengan kotak centang:\n\n```html\n<!-- Checkbox Standar -->\n<div class=\"form-check mb-2\">\n  <input class=\"form-check-input\" type=\"checkbox\" id=\"checkIngat\">\n  <label class=\"form-check-label\" for=\"checkIngat\">Ingat saya di perangkat ini</label>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Saklar Modern Bergaya Ponsel (*Toggle Switch*) -->\n<div class=\"form-check form-switch mb-3\">\n  <input class=\"form-check-input\" type=\"checkbox\" role=\"switch\" id=\"switchNotif\" checked>\n  <label class=\"form-check-label\" for=\"switchNotif\">Aktifkan notifikasi email</label>\n</div>\n```\n\n---\n\n## 5. Validasi Formulir Interaktif\n\nBootstrap menyediakan umpan balik warna hijau (*valid*) dan merah (*invalid*) yang sangat informatif:\n\n```html\n<form class=\"needs-validation\" novalidate>\n  <div class=\"mb-3\">\n    <label class=\"form-label\">Nama Pengguna</label>\n    <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-control\" required>\n    \n    <!-- Pesan Muncul Jika Validasi Berhasil -->\n    <div class=\"valid-feedback\">Format nama sudah sesuai!</div>\n    \n    <!-- Pesan Muncul Jika Kolom Masih Kosong -->\n    <div class=\"invalid-feedback\">Nama pengguna wajib diisi.</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" type=\"submit\">Kirim Formulir</button>\n</form>\n\n<script>\n  // Skrip Standar Bootstrap untuk Mencegah Submit Jika Input Tidak Valid\n  (() => {\n    'use strict'\n    const forms = document.querySelectorAll('.needs-validation')\n    Array.from(forms).forEach(form => {\n      form.addEventListener('submit', event => {\n        if (!form.checkValidity()) {\n          event.preventDefault()\n          event.stopPropagation()\n        }\n        form.classList.add('was-validated')\n      }, false)\n    })\n  })()\n</script>\n```\nSaat form disubmit, class `.was-validated` ditambahkan ke form, otomatis menyalakan outline hijau atau merah pada masing-masing input.\n","excerpt":"#programming","readingTime":3,"updated":null,"contentHash":"sha256:e516c4cee56892ff432f83e59675864f99fbe0a667c18a20a427e0d1cb0f75ea","outputPath":"Pemrograman/CSS/Bootstrap/06. Formulir dan Validasi","breadcrumb":["Pemrograman","CSS","Bootstrap"],"links":[],"backlinks":[{"id":"pemrograman/css/bootstrap/03_bootstrap","title":"03_Bootstrap"}],"brokenLinks":[],"html":"<p>Bootstrap 5 menyediakan sistem penataan formulir yang bersih, mudah diakses melalui keyboard, dan mendukung validasi visual yang responsif.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"1-elemen-input-standar-form-controls\">1. Elemen Input Standar (<em>Form Controls</em>)</h2>\n<p>Gunakan class <code>.form-control</code> pada tag <code>&#x3C;input></code> atau <code>&#x3C;textarea></code> agar input memiliki padding proporsional, border lembut, dan fokus ring berwarna biru:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"mb-3\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">for</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"inputEmail\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"form-label fw-semibold small\"</span>></span>Alamat Email<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"email\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"form-control rounded-3\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"inputEmail\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">placeholder</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"nama@domain.com\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"form-text text-secondary\"</span>></span>Kami tidak akan membagikan email Anda kepada pihak ketiga.<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n</code></pre>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"2-label-melayang-modern-floating-labels\">2. Label Melayang Modern (<em>Floating Labels</em>)</h2>\n<p>Bootstrap 5 memperkenalkan fitur <em>Floating Labels</em> tanpa membutuhkan pustaka luar. Cukup bungkus input dan label di dalam container ber-class <code>.form-floating</code>:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"form-floating mb-3\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&#x3C;!-- Wajib sertakan atribut placeholder meskipun kosong --></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"email\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"form-control\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"floatingEmail\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">placeholder</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"nama@domain.com\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">for</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"floatingEmail\"</span>></span>Ketikkan Alamat Email<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n</code></pre>\n<p>Saat input dalam keadaan kosong, teks label berada di tengah. Begitu pengguna mengklik atau mengetik teks, label otomatis melayang naik ke atas dengan ukuran huruf lebih kecil.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"3-gabungan-input-dan-ikon-input-groups\">3. Gabungan Input dan Ikon (<em>Input Groups</em>)</h2>\n<p>Gunakan <code>.input-group</code> untuk menempelkan teks simbol mata uang, ikon, atau tombol langsung di samping kotak input:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">&#x3C;!-- Input dengan Awalan Simbol Mata Uang --></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"input-group mb-3\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"input-group-text bg-light text-secondary\"</span>></span>Rp<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"number\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"form-control\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">placeholder</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"100000\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"input-group-text bg-light text-secondary\"</span>></span>,00<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span>></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">&#x3C;!-- Input Pencarian Lengkap dengan Tombol Aksi --></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"input-group\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"text\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"form-control\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">placeholder</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"Cari artikel...\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"btn btn-primary\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"button\"</span>></span>Cari<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span>></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n</code></pre>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"4-kotak-centang-radio-dan-saklar-switches\">4. Kotak Centang, Radio, dan Saklar (<em>Switches</em>)</h2>\n<p>Gunakan <code>.form-check</code> untuk menjaga agar teks label sejajar sempurna dengan kotak centang:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">&#x3C;!-- Checkbox Standar --></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"form-check mb-2\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"form-check-input\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"checkbox\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"checkIngat\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"form-check-label\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">for</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"checkIngat\"</span>></span>Ingat saya di perangkat ini<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">&#x3C;!-- Saklar Modern Bergaya Ponsel (*Toggle Switch*) --></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"form-check form-switch mb-3\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"form-check-input\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"checkbox\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">role</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"switch\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"switchNotif\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">checked</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"form-check-label\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">for</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"switchNotif\"</span>></span>Aktifkan notifikasi email<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n</code></pre>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"5-validasi-formulir-interaktif\">5. Validasi Formulir Interaktif</h2>\n<p>Bootstrap menyediakan umpan balik warna hijau (<em>valid</em>) dan merah (<em>invalid</em>) yang sangat informatif:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">form</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"needs-validation\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">novalidate</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"mb-3\"</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"form-label\"</span>></span>Nama Pengguna<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"text\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"form-control\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">required</span>></span>\n    \n    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&#x3C;!-- Pesan Muncul Jika Validasi Berhasil --></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"valid-feedback\"</span>></span>Format nama sudah sesuai!<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n    \n    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&#x3C;!-- Pesan Muncul Jika Kolom Masih Kosong --></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"invalid-feedback\"</span>></span>Nama pengguna wajib diisi.<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"btn btn-primary\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"submit\"</span>></span>Kirim Formulir<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span>></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">form</span>></span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">script</span>></span><span class=\"javascript\">\n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Skrip Standar Bootstrap untuk Mencegah Submit Jika Input Tidak Valid</span>\n  (<span class=\"hljs-function\">() =></span> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-string\">'use strict'</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> forms = <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">querySelectorAll</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">'.needs-validation'</span>)\n    <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Array</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">from</span>(forms).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">forEach</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\"><span class=\"hljs-params\">form</span> =></span> {\n      form.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">addEventListener</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">'submit'</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\"><span class=\"hljs-params\">event</span> =></span> {\n        <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (!form.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">checkValidity</span>()) {\n          event.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">preventDefault</span>()\n          event.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">stopPropagation</span>()\n        }\n        form.<span class=\"hljs-property\">classList</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">add</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">'was-validated'</span>)\n      }, <span class=\"hljs-literal\">false</span>)\n    })\n  })()\n</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">script</span>></span>\n</code></pre>\n<p>Saat form disubmit, class <code>.was-validated</code> ditambahkan ke form, otomatis menyalakan outline hijau atau merah pada masing-masing input.</p>","previous":"pemrograman/css/bootstrap/05.-komponen-ui-esensial","next":"pemrograman/css/bootstrap/07.-navigasi-dan-header"}